Add an additional check for settings package to determine if the caller
is CDCA

Bug: 517378646
NO_IFTTT=CDCA package check applies to SystemUI only; System Server Utils.isBackground does not track class names.
Test: N/A
Flag: EXEMPT CVE_FIX
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:76b15a24c4c674f96b38bdeaacceb33da3124dda
Merged-In: I64189a73ba9028b67574496e4e2772387027459a
